WEBVTT

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.240
Hey, Yuri.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:19.410
Why will going to Soul Island
help us find Pirika?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:24.210
The World Tree Library on Soul Island
is where Yggdra is.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.790
Yggdra?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.640
Yggdra has the same name as this continent.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.900
She's special, even among the fairies.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.230
Special?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:37.210
Yeah.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.590
She has the Chronicle.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:37.260
<b>Unyielding Will</b>

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:35.740
The island...

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:36.840
Let's hurry.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.130
Vienta.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.780
There's no time to talk.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:55.860
Follow me.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.070
You're here to see Yggdra, aren't you?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.260
Yes.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.410
But I didn't expect to see 
Soul Island like this.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.980
Don't worry.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.080
I'll get you there safely.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.140
Pops.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.330
Rafalgar.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.460
There you are, Vienta.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.940
Take those two with you.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.250
I know.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.200
Let's go.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:47.790
Right!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.670
What's wrong?

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.170
Yuri.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.050
Yuri?

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.460
That's Yuri?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.190
Why are you here?

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.360
Say something!

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.690
I have no reason to respond to you.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.360
What?

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:31.170
You're the one who said 
we should fight together.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:34.790
And yet, look at you now!

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.380
Your sword's in tatters.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.130
Doesn't your weapon reflect your soul?

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:43.630
Is that what you're like right now?!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:48.140
The Black King can't be defeated.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.110
These bastards...

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:04.600
Power of blackness, my ass.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.480
You'll understand soon enough.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.630
No, I won't.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.630
Aram!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.660
Pops!

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.600
Get going, kid!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.910
You didn't come here to fight him, did you?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:49.890
But...

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.910
Isn't there something you need to do?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.920
Hurry up and go!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.030
Let's go, Phoena.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.470
Yuri...

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.440
Over here.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:57.390
Yggd—

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.100
Phoena!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.520
I'm okay.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.060
Hurry inside,

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:07.450
while Arbol's barrier lasts.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.660
The Chronicle is ready.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.850
Let us make haste.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.340
Whoa.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:25.100
To the core.

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.800
The Chronicle.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.140
We're going inside.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.070
Isn't this the Vice Capital?

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:03.070
We're inside Yggdra's Chronicle.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.990
What is this?

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:13.510
These are records of the continent 
of Yggdra, kept in the Chronicle.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:18.970
The whole history of the continent 
is kept here, in great detail.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.350
So it's the same as yours?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.480
It's not in the same league 
as the Chain Chronicle.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:30.690
The Chain Chronicle is an outline 
of the history of the entire world,

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.240
including this continent.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:38.520
My Chronicle has the most detailed 
information regarding this continent.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.500
That's the way it is.

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:47.710
Now, let's go through the 
Chronicle to find Pirika.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.840
It's the battle at the Royal Castle.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.800
I'm not done yet!

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.980
Yuri!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.020
Are you all right?

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.410
Yuri!

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:15.620
It's no use.

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:20.040
We can't influence the world
inside the Chronicle.

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:33.610
This is the moment we lost Pirika.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:40.990
Pirika...

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:47.140
Let's begin our search 
from the records at this point..

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:57.050
This is when we retreated 
from the Royal Capital.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:07.390
I knew Yuri was suffering, 
yet I couldn't do anything for him.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:11.760
I was too powerless.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.500
You'll have to go through me!

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.730
Are you really Yuri?

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:57.670
Pops!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.400
This is...

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.240
Phoena!

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.520
Aram!

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:37.510
Isn't that Yuri?

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.800
It's Yuri when he was younger.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.690
Stay back.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.690
Thank you, sir.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:28.330
Were they from the Black Army
that's been attacking the continent recently?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.220
Yeah.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.550
That move...

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:37.060
If only I had such moves...

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.820
I could fight if the village
ever came under attack.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.320
Then you'll have to train.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:48.320
Will I be able to do it if I train?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.000
I can't guarantee it.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:52.820
Well...

00:12:53.450 --> 00:13:01.460
Train for days, months, even years, 
and you may never learn the skill.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:10.210
But if you can maintain a spirit of 
perseverance, some day, you will.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:13.740
Perseverance...

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:06.860
The village...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.900
You people!

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.050
Damn it!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:42.770
Isn't that...

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.380
Guys...

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:03.120
Hello?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.630
Is there anyone here?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.570
If only...

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.050
If only I were...

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:31.400
I don't want to go through this ever again.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.390
Yuri...

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.220
Then why did you...

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.590
Yuri!

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:59.100
You've always helped me up to now.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.450
This time, it's my turn to save you.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:10.470
Yuri's turning black.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:14.880
Impossible.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:16.090
Him?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.250
Why?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.410
I don't have much time.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.740
I tried to protect people.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.510
Yet I couldn't protect anything.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.840
That's not true.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.990
No, it's true.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:36.580
I'm determined to defeat the Black King.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.220
But...

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:47.490
At some point, I may have been paralyzed
by the weight of my armor.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:55.750
It might be that we made you feel that way.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.990
We've burdened you with too much…

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.450
That's not true.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:05.170
It was my decision to defeat the Black King.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.420
But I couldn't do it.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.260
So...

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.770
Kain, please.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:16.050
I want you to guide Aram for me.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:22.550
Aram can be a ray of hope 
in this world of darkness.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.700
He has potential.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:28.650
Yuri...

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.110
What the hell is that supposed to mean?

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.230
Hi. We meet again.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.240
You're the old dude from the snow.

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.080
Um... Balto...

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.870
Baltazari.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.580
Remember it.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.240
Huh?

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.420
How come I can talk to you?

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.010
There isn't anything I can't do.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.660
You can do anything?

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.050
You could say that.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:04.140
Then I have a request.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.830
A request?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.460
You can do anything, can't you?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.020
Make me strong.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.870
Strong, you say?

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.110
The reason?

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.920
I want to bring Yuri back.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.420
But I can't do it right now.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:32.380
I need to become stronger, beat down 
Yuri, and bring him to his senses.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.220
I see.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.880
In that case...

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.330
Aram?

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.170
Yuri!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:51.900
Stay back!

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.370
Damn it!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.630
Aram.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.370
It's okay.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.490
Y-You...

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:31.310
Just let go and you'll find peace.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.810
Why would I?

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.230
Aram!

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.040
Enough.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.760
Forget about me.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.310
No way.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.290
Aram!

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:53.180
This is undignified.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.290
Give it up.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.420
Aram...

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.890
Don't you dare give up, Yuri!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.200
I was always alone.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:12.980
So...

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:18.440
So when you told me to come 
with you, I was happy.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:23.680
"Potential," my foot.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.780
"Ray of hope in the darkness," my ass.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:29.120
Don't go around saying whatever you want!

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.900
I'm not letting go of you.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:39.300
I won't give up on you.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.450
Nonsense.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.750
Give up!

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:48.680
Shut up, idiot!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.940
Now, Aram!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.580
Ready your sword!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.780
Seize the light!

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.020
<i>It's the light.</i>

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:42.250
<i>I'll return when everyone 
finds the light of hope again.</i>

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:51.510
I...

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.810
Aram!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:54.790
Phoena.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.080
You're safe.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.030
You, too.

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:58.500
Thank goodness.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:00.010
Furball.

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:04.010
I heard it just as I was coming back.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.090
Pirika's voice.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:15.620
It seems you've found your answer.

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:19.720
That child, though...

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:21.920
It couldn't be...

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:26.330
You're safe.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.660
Rafalgar.

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:32.220
You need healing.

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:33.470
I'm fine.

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:35.070
Take care of my fool of a daughter.

00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:40.520
That bastard left the Chronicle black.

00:22:43.650 --> 00:22:45.970
We still haven't lost hope.

00:22:46.620 --> 00:22:50.050
We learned that Pirika will come back.

00:22:50.690 --> 00:22:55.180
But with my Chronicle having 
been stained black as well,

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:57.130
we no longer have a moment to spare.

00:22:57.970 --> 00:22:59.340
Hurry.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:06.980
Your Majesty, we have visitors from the 
Nine Territories requesting an audience.

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:12.280
Haruaki, Toka,

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:16.910
do you mean to tell me that
you want to take down Shuza?

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:22.380
If Shuza were to join forces 
with the Black King...

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:26.250
We would not allow him to continue 
any more than you would.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>The Flower in the Desert</b>

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:48.810
Fate is set in motion.
